if QuestManager.is_quest_not_started("talk_to_researcher_1"):
	security: You're talking to me before you've gotten a quest.
	security: Are you ready to receive a quest?
	- Yes
		security: Great.
	- No, but yes
		security: This is my response when you say no but yes.
	security: I'm now giving you explanatory dialogue about the quest.
	security: Or maybe just some additional dialogue for fun.
	security: You now feel ready to take on the quest.
	[signal arg="quest_started:talk_to_perkins"]
	[signal arg="floor_unlocked:b2"]

elif QuestManager.is_quest_in_progress("talk_to_security") == true:
	security: Oh Hatch 41 needs me? I'll bring my toolkit.
	[signal arg="objective_completed:talk_to_security:talk_to_benebolant_objective"]

elif QuestManager.is_quest_in_progress("talk_to_researcher_1") == true:
	security: You're talking to me after you've gotten a quest.

elif QuestManager.is_quest_completed("talk_to_researcher_1") and not PlayerData.has_received_signature_from("security"):
	if {battle_outcome} == "lose" or {battle_outcome} == "survive":
		security: Ready to try again?
		- Yes
			[signal arg="battle_accepted"]
		- No
			security: Come back when you're ready.
	else:
		security: Thank you for talking to Perkins.
		security: I'll give you my signature... but only if you can defeat me in a rhythm battle
		- Yes
			[signal arg="battle_accepted"]
		- No
			security: Come back when you're ready.

else:
	security: No more talking, phew!